{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 97,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.16120147705078,
        78.81909942626953,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        69.16120147705078,
        526.9632568359375,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "An efficient sample transportation system, with sustainable funding mechanisms, is crucial",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        84.66120147705078,
        526.9631958007812,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "for feasibility, especially if an algorithm requires multiple samples at different times from",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        100.16120147705078,
        526.7320556640625,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "different collection points, as is the case when dealing with DR-TB. If mishandled during",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        115.66120147705078,
        526.6089477539062,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "preparation, there is a risk that the sample may become contaminated and yield inconclusive",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.955711364746094,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        131.16119384765625,
        526.9313354492188,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "results on molecular diagnostics. Participants cited good personnel skills, standardized",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        146.66119384765625,
        526.592529296875,
        159.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "operating procedures and significant laboratory infrastructure as essential in reducing",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        162.16119384765625,
        288.78961181640625,
        175.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "sample contamination in their laboratory.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03409576416016,
        177.84820556640625,
        134.5670928955078,
        190.7292022705078
      ],
      "text": "Interviews",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        193.16119384765625,
        78.81909942626953,
        206.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        193.16119384765625,
        526.6388549804688,
        206.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "The feasibility of low complexity automated NAATs is challenged if there is an accumulation",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.978879928588867,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        208.66119384765625,
        526.8983764648438,
        221.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "of diagnostic delays or underuse (or both) at every step in the process, mainly because of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        224.16119384765625,
        191.6721954345703,
        237.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "health system factors:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86620330810547,
        239.66119384765625,
        95.91820526123047,
        252.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86620330810547,
        239.66119384765625,
        527.2120971679688,
        252.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "non-adherence to testing algorithms, testing for TB or MDR-TB late in the process,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86620330810547,
        255.16119384765625,
        527.1282958984375,
        268.30621337890625
      ],
      "text": "empirical treatment, false negatives due to technology failure, large sample volumes and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.951493263244629,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86620330810547,
        270.66119384765625,
        526.9634399414062,
        283.80621337890625
      ],
      "text": "staff shortages, poor or delayed sample transport and sample quality, poor or delayed",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86620330810547,
        286.16119384765625,
        526.9591064453125,
        299.30621337890625
      ],
      "text": "communication of results, delays in scheduling follow-up visits and recalling patients,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86620330810547,
        301.66119384765625,
        284.91259765625,
        314.80621337890625
      ],
      "text": "and inconsistent recording of results;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        317.16119384765625,
        95.91809844970703,
        330.30621337890625
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        317.16119384765625,
        526.9026489257812,
        330.30621337890625
      ],
      "text": "lack of sufficient resources and maintenance (e.g. stock-outs; unreliable logistics; lack of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.984739303588867,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        332.6612243652344,
        526.9259643554688,
        345.8062438964844
      ],
      "text": "funding, electricity, space, air conditioners and sputum containers; dusty environment;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        348.1612243652344,
        311.7192687988281,
        361.3062438964844
      ],
      "text": "and delayed or absent local repair option);",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86620330810547,
        363.6612243652344,
        95.91820526123047,
        376.8062438964844
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86620330810547,
        363.6612243652344,
        526.9629516601562,
        376.8062438964844
      ],
      "text": "inefficient or unclear workflows and patient flows (e.g. inefficient organizational",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86620330810547,
        379.1612243652344,
        527.1902465820312,
        392.3062438964844
      ],
      "text": "processes, poor links between providers, and unclear follow-up mechanisms or",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86620330810547,
        394.6612243652344,
        338.5841064453125,
        407.8062438964844
      ],
      "text": "information on where patients need to go); and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86620330810547,
        410.1612243652344,
        95.91820526123047,
        423.3062438964844
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86620330810547,
        410.1612243652344,
        438.4920349121094,
        423.3062438964844
      ],
      "text": "lack of data-driven and inclusive national implementation processes.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86620330810547,
        425.8482360839844,
        206.10025024414062,
        438.7292175292969
      ],
      "text": "QES: high confidence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        443.99591064453125,
        78.81920623779297,
        457.14093017578125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81920623779297,
        443.99591064453125,
        526.9751586914062,
        457.14093017578125
      ],
      "text": "The feasibility of using low complexity automated NAATs is also challenged by the value of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        459.49591064453125,
        526.9642944335938,
        472.64093017578125
      ],
      "text": "diagnosing MTB over DR-TB at primary care. This situation makes the NAAT less feasible as",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        474.99591064453125,
        478.4804992675781,
        488.14093017578125
      ],
      "text": "a baseline test, although it would fit at a district or intermediate level laboratory.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        503.3421325683594,
        275.1542053222656,
        519.7221069335938
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        528.4730224609375,
        526.8270263671875,
        541.6180419921875
      ],
      "text": "Factors to consider when implementing low complexity automated NAATs for detection of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        542.4730224609375,
        404.29302978515625,
        555.6180419921875
      ],
      "text": "resistance to isoniazid and second-line anti-TB agents are as follows:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        562.2249755859375,
        78.81920623779297,
        575.3699951171875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81920623779297,
        562.2249755859375,
        526.97509765625,
        575.3699951171875
      ],
      "text": "local epidemiological data on resistance prevalence should guide local testing algorithms,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        577.7249755859375,
        495.74957275390625,
        590.8699951171875
      ],
      "text": "whereas pretest probability is important for the clinical interpretation of test results;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        593.2249755859375,
        78.81920623779297,
        606.3699951171875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81920623779297,
        593.2249755859375,
        527.1055908203125,
        606.3699951171875
      ],
      "text": "the cost of a test varies depending on parameters such as the number of samples in a batch",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.996349334716797,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        608.7249755859375,
        493.57275390625,
        621.8699951171875
      ],
      "text": "and the staff time required; therefore, a local costing exercise should be performed;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        624.2249755859375,
        78.81920623779297,
        637.3699951171875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81920623779297,
        624.2249755859375,
        526.9972534179688,
        637.3699951171875
      ],
      "text": "low, moderate and high complexity tests have successive increase in technical competency",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        639.7249755859375,
        501.88970947265625,
        652.8699951171875
      ],
      "text": "needs (qualifications and skills) and staff time, which affects planning and budgeting;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        655.2249755859375,
        78.81920623779297,
        668.3699951171875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81920623779297,
        655.2249755859375,
        526.997314453125,
        668.3699951171875
      ],
      "text": "availability and timeliness of local support services and maintenance should be considered",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        670.7249755859375,
        214.45289611816406,
        683.8699951171875
      ],
      "text": "when selecting a provider;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        686.2249755859375,
        78.81920623779297,
        699.3699951171875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81920623779297,
        686.2249755859375,
        526.88720703125,
        699.3699951171875
      ],
      "text": "laboratory accreditation and compliance with a robust quality management system",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        701.7249755859375,
        524.4273681640625,
        714.8699951171875
      ],
      "text": "(including appropriate quality control) are essential for sustained service excellence and trust;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        717.2249755859375,
        78.81920623779297,
        730.3699951171875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81920623779297,
        717.2249755859375,
        527.0226440429688,
        730.3699951171875
      ],
      "text": "training of both laboratory and clinical staff will ensure effective delivery of services and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        732.7249755859375,
        157.5504150390625,
        745.8699951171875
      ],
      "text": "clinical impact;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        748.2249755859375,
        78.81920623779297,
        761.3699951171875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81920623779297,
        748.2249755859375,
        526.94140625,
        761.3699951171875
      ],
      "text": "use of connectivity solutions for communication of results is encouraged, to improve",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        763.7249755859375,
        381.5943298339844,
        776.8699951171875
      ],
      "text": "efficiency of service delivery and time to treatment initiation;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        353.2680969238281,
        802.0169067382812,
        554.5132446289062,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "2. Recommendations for diagnosis of TB disease 81",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}